('linked-list-cycle', 'Linked List Cycle', 'LINKED_LISTS', 'EASY',
 'Given the head of a linked list, determine whether the list contains a cycle. Use O(1) extra memory.'),
('remove-nth-node-from-end', 'Remove Nth Node From End of List', 'LINKED_LISTS', 'MEDIUM',
 'Given the head of a linked list, remove the nth node from the end of the list and return its head. Try to do it in one pass.'),
('reorder-list', 'Reorder List', 'LINKED_LISTS', 'MEDIUM',
